<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>PhoneRakshak Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="date">Last updated: May 5, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>Welcome to PhoneRakshak. We are committed to protecting your privacy and providing a secure anti-theft solution. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose information when you use our mobile application and related services.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>To provide our core anti-theft features, we collect the following sensitive data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Location Data (Background & Foreground):</strong> We continuously collect your device's GPS location to allow you to track your device in the event of theft or loss.</li>
      <li><strong>Camera & Photos:</strong> We access your camera to silently capture intruder photos if unauthorized access is detected (e.g., failed unlock attempts).</li>
      <li><strong>Audio Recordings:</strong> When triggered remotely via the emergency/surveillance command, we record ambient audio.</li>
      <li><strong>SMS Data:</strong> We require SMS permissions to intercept unauthorized SIM swaps and send emergency alerts.</li>
      <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> We collect hardware models, operating system versions, unique device identifiers, and mobile network information.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information we collect strictly to provide the anti-theft features you have enabled:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To locate your device on a map via the web portal.</li>
      <li>To send alerts and intruder evidence to your registered emergency contacts and web dashboard.</li>
      <li>To secure your device (locking, triggering alarms) remotely.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
    <p>Your data is securely transmitted over HTTPS and stored on our protected servers. We do not sell or share your data with third parties for marketing purposes. You can delete your device and all associated data from the web portal at any time.</p>

    <h2>5. User Consent</h2>
    <p>By installing and configuring the PhoneRakshak app, you explicitly grant permission for the collection of the data described above. The app will display prominent disclosures before requesting these permissions.</p>

    <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at support@phonerakshak.com.</p>
  </div>
